    fix: bypass multimodal path for gemma_4_e4b_it (text-only checkpoint)
    
    - Switch hf_name to principled-intelligence/gemma-4-E4B-it-text-only
      (community text-only checkpoint, vision/audio weights stripped)
    - Add 'text-only' family override to is_multimodal detection so
      AutoModelForCausalLM + AutoTokenizer are used instead of
      AutoModelForMultimodalLM + AutoProcessor, eliminating the
      torchvision.transforms.v2.functional import chain
    - Remove dead resolve_low_vram_device_map vision/audio tower mapping
    - Remove torchvision from requirements-colab.txt (was pulling CPU-only
      build from PyPI, conflicting with CUDA torch)
    - Add ensure_torchvision_from_cuda_index() safety net in
      run_colab_experiment.py to install torchvision from the correct
      PyTorch CUDA wheel index when needed

